    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "which coincides with the Fourier coefficients of the corresponding 2π-periodic complex-valued function f˜ : R → C, f˜(x) = f(eix). Similarly, other results such as the completeness, orthogonality relations and Plancherel’s theorem generalise to the non-abelian case via the Peter-Weyl theorems and representation theory."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 38,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 56.693, 213.101, 555.312, 238.675 ],
    "font" : "LMRoman10-Regular",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Heat kernels on simply-connected compact semi-simple Lie groups were studied in Ref. [32], together with a useful Poisson form. In Section IV we show how to apply those results for PU(d), which is not simply-connected."
  }, {
    "type" : "heading",
