    "id" : 41,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 56.693, 99.665, 555.312, 150.095 ],
    "font" : "LMRoman10-Italic",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Result 1. The main technical result of the paper is the construction of the polynomial approximation to the Dirac delta function HP(t)(·,σ) on PU(d), together with some of its properties. This allows us to summarise the key properties of the family of polynomial approximations of Dirac delta based on the trimmed heat kernels (see Theorem 3 for a precise statement."
